  "ingredients": [
    "1 (4 pound) corned beef brisket, seasoning packet discarded",
    "1.5 teaspoons garlic powder",
    "1.5 teaspoons onion powder",
    "1 (12 ounce) bottle beer"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/8Vvif8uUNU60NVfc0InqnNGr0Yk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-256749-pressure-cooker-corned-beef-brisket-VAT-4x3-step-01-30ac4d2977484d228fd15629a7f85e41.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/256749/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place brisket fat-side up on a rack inside an electric pressure cooker. Sprinkle garlic powder and onion powder over brisket; pour beer into the pot.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/U1iTPXqnWRcy_Hv5ksSG9vuhKhw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-256749-pressure-cooker-corned-beef-brisket-VAT-4x3-step-02-34414cb1ea08494d87e48f4653c3f284.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/256749/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Close and lock the lid. Select \"Meat\" setting according to manufacturer's instructions; set timer for 1 hour 30 minutes. Allow 10 to 15 minutes for pressure to build.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/UiiuLi5r2CpOsGwnTjpHLe45-Ug=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-256749-pressure-cooker-corned-beef-brisket-VAT-4x3-step-03-109ae31c965f419a9ff1b97a5fc1cd29.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/256749/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Release pressure using the natural-release method according to manufacturer's instructions, 10 to 40 minutes. Unlock and remove the lid.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/JjxdyXL9190kC4oJ0qj7-vxrPEk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-256749-pressure-cooker-corned-beef-brisket-VAT-4x3-step-04-4182765aeb6c4de0b6cf40fa240074af.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/256749/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer brisket to a cutting board; remove the top layer of fat and slice across the grain.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
